POST {{baseUrl}}/lab/parties/{{createParty.response.body.id}}/members/{{createParty.response.body.members[0].id}}/grants
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "card", "cardId": "fixture.blade-of-dusk", "quantity": 1 }

### FEAT-10 — doar zona (400 LAB_GRANT_INVALID notGrantable)
POST {{baseUrl}}/lab/parties/{{createParty.response.body.id}}/members/{{createParty.response.body.members[0].id}}/grants
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "card", "cardId": "fixture.gray-harbor", "quantity": 1 }

